# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18) on the `protobuf` wire.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   2   y with z: nothing is written when z is not held; z = 0 holds
#   4   names, a scalar `pstring` item with val: a suppressed item is an
#       empty occurrence (ruling 4, ruling 11 of 0.7)
format  conformance-cond-protobuf
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    protobuf
field   probe.x  1  pvarint
field   probe.y  2  pvarint  with probe.z
field   probe.z  3  pvarint
group   probe.names  4
  field probe.tag  .  pstring  with probe.val
end
